An (almost) de-sloppified fork of microduck_rl.

Last synced commit: https://github.com/pollen-robotics/microduck_rl/commit/08b2458b8ff6d64e58bbff069fc1976d89f93fbc

You'll need a graphics card that supports CUDA, plus uv and make.

    make sync    # install
    make help    # list every target
